890
01:12:59,812 --> 01:13:00,152
[SPEAKER_01] Ima svega.

891
01:13:00,372 --> 01:13:00,932
[SPEAKER_00] Jako dobro.

892
01:13:00,932 --> 01:13:05,532
[SPEAKER_04] Ne znaš, ono, kao ono, nije opekom oča. Drago mi je što je napokon bilo vanka.

893
01:13:08,341 --> 01:13:09,241
[SPEAKER_02] Uglavnom to je to.

894
01:13:09,281 --> 01:13:11,001
[SPEAKER_04] Što je bilo pivice, bilo svega.

895
01:13:11,161 --> 01:13:13,281
[SPEAKER_00] Bilo je pivice, bilo je svega, bilo je vanka.

896
01:13:14,081 --> 01:13:15,521
[SPEAKER_01] 9 mjeseca je bilo to.

897
01:13:15,661 --> 01:13:19,301
[SPEAKER_02] Ima saba i pored.

898
01:13:21,807 --> 01:13:23,407
[SPEAKER_02] I se može...

899
01:13:23,407 --> 01:13:26,887
