[SPEAKER_04] Jel bi ja u krugu, brate?

940
01:17:37,098 --> 01:17:38,618
[SPEAKER_00] Da, imaju u Ropi.

941
01:17:38,838 --> 01:17:42,018
[SPEAKER_03] Ti znaš da kada on bude u krugu opet mi imamo album, jel?

942
01:17:42,323 --> 01:17:45,323
[SPEAKER_00] Nije

943
